  parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first block holds the exact strings extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/BatteryDegradationForecastWidget.tsx +
  registry/battery.ts). The remaining keys back the native-only chrome (freshness
  chip, refresh/retry, empty/error/banner copy, accessibility).
*/

